flowchart TD
S([Authenticated history operation]) --> G[US-15 authentication and owner gate]
G --> A{Trigger?}
A -- Owned recipe detail opened --> U[Upsert one view record with server lastViewedAt]
U --> D[Return details after history commit]
A -- List history --> L[Read owned views joined to owned recipes]
L --> O[Order by lastViewedAt descending; stable id tie-breaker]
O --> R[200 recipes and timestamps or empty list]
A -- Generate or favorite only --> N[Do not create a view record]
D --> F([Inventory unchanged])
R --> F
N --> F
